%, unhealthy in us-east, us-west, eu-west). Attempted rollback to v2.3.0 (most recent healthy production release) was rejected because v2.3.0 is quarantined for CVE-2026-4417. Rolled back instead to v2.2.9, the next most recent release that was healthy in production; rollout completed in all three production regions. Follow-ups needed: (1) root-cause the v2.3.1 failure, (2) produce a fixed build that also addresses CVE-2026-4417, since v2.2.9 predates the v2.3.0 fix set, (3) verify error rate has recovered post-rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 24518, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_019zvomoHgGq1fv1rdhvxLRu", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 24518, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_019zvomoHgGq1fv1rdhvxLRu", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 30021, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "Done. Summary of what I did:\n\n**Findings**\n- checkout-api was on v2.3.1 in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), unhealthy with an 18% error rate.\n- Release history: v2.2.9 (healthy) \u2192 v2.3.0 (healthy) \u2192 v2.3.1 (unhealthy). v2.3.1-rc was staging-only.\n\n**Rollback**\n- First tried v2.3.0, the most recent healthy production release \u2014 **rejected** because it's quarantined for CVE-2026-4417.\n- Rolled back to **v2.2.9**, the next most recent release that was healthy in production. Rollout completed in all three regions.\n- Post-rollback status: **healthy**, error rate down from 18% to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- Opened **INC-0001** (SEV2) for checkout-api; on-call has been paged. The summary documents the failure, the blocked v2.3.0 attempt, the v2.2.9 rollback, and follow-ups (root-cause v2.3.1, and produce a fixed build that also covers CVE-2026-4417 since v2.2.9 predates that fix).\n\nOne thing to flag: v2.2.9 is a version older than the CVE fix, so the service is stable but should be treated as a temporary state until a patched build is ready.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by checking the current status and release history for checkout-api.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01CLLAhh5QNLLAi4PwjLeuwm", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01V4KU2RmfQPCroggZeqArPj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_013fSozx1tXQ5shwLeph423c", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_011NukgQ1vhUckgMafac8yRV", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.2.9"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The rollback to v2.2.9 completed in all three regions. Now verifying health and opening the SEV2 incident.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01LNVodLF1keadPydxsqfiBZ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_019zvomo